Extract ONLY information explicitly stated by the user.

Return JSON only:

{
  "facts": [
    {
      "fact_type":
        "balance|minimum_balance|amount|currency|date|income|expense|installment_count|payment_frequency|financing_fee|description|request_type",
      "value": "...",
